Package: webmeasy
Version: 0.2.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libssl3
Maintainer: Fad-X <Fad-X@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Web application enumeration tool for external attack surface mapping
 Maps external attack surface via subfinder subdomain enumeration,
 httpx host probing, Nuclei vulnerability scanning, backup/config
 fuzzing, and exposed .git detection. Outputs professional PDF reports.
